 da: angular width (degrees), \n#      v: median velocity (km/s)\n#     dv: variation (1 sigma) of velocity over the width of the CME\n#   minv: lowest velocity detected within the CME\n#   maxv: highest velocity detected within the CME\n#  halo?: II if da>90, III if da>180, IV if da>270, indicating potential halo/partial halo CME\n# \n  </PRE>\n <td valign='top'>\n  <PRE>\n# CME |          t0    | dt0| pa | da |  v  |  dv | minv| maxv| halo?\n  <a href=\"CME0024/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0024</a>|2026/09/13 07:24| 01 | 312| 006| 1328| 0670| 0400| 1959|    \n  <a href=\"CME0023/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0023</a>|2026/09/12 22:12| 02 | 359| 088| 1584| 0625| 0174| 1896|    \n  <a href=\"CME0022/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0022</a>|2026/09/12 21:12| 03 | 278| 042| 1302| 0523| 0183| 1896|    \n  <a href=\"CME0021/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0021</a>|2026/09/12 20:36| 01 | 258| 006| 0535| 0041| 0495| 0600|    \n  <a href=\"CME0020/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0020</a>|2026/09/12 16:00| 02 | 334| 010| 0123| 0012| 0108| 0138|    \n  <a href=\"CME0019/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0019</a>|2026/09/12 14:00| 08 | 198| 122| 019"
